---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/homepage/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/shared/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="About | Zephyr"
	description="Curated data products for AI builders — crypto datasets, APIs, and domain-specific tools. Not templates. Real data infrastructure."
>
	<Navbar />
	<main class="about-page">
		<h1>About Zephyr</h1>

		<p class="about-lead">Zephyr (zephyrdn.com) is a curated data product company. We build high-quality datasets, APIs, and AI tools for crypto researchers, quantitative analysts, and AI builders.</p>

		<h2>Why Data Products?</h2>

		<p>The AI era runs on data. But here's the problem: most publicly available datasets are noisy, inconsistent, and undocumented. Every researcher and builder wastes hours cleaning, aligning, and validating — before they can do any actual work.</p>

		<p>We believe <strong>data preparation is infrastructure</strong>. It shouldn't be the first thing every team rebuilds from scratch. It should be a product you can buy, trust, and plug into your pipeline immediately.</p>

		<p>That's what Zephyr builds. Curated, validated, documented datasets — ready for AI training, backtesting, and quantitative research.</p>

		<h2>Our Approach</h2>

		<div class="approach-grid">
			<div class="approach-item">
				<h3>Multi-Exchange Alignment</h3>
				<p>Every data point is benchmarked against a median price across multiple exchanges. Outliers flagged at 3% deviation. You get a single source of truth, not four conflicting numbers.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="approach-item">
				<h3>Full Provenance</h3>
				<p>Every dataset ships with a source manifest, audit trail, and compliance report. You know exactly where every number came from and how it was processed.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="approach-item">
				<h3>AI-Ready Format</h3>
				<p>Hive-partitioned Parquet files. DuckDB, Pandas, PyTorch — drop in and go. No CSV parsing, no schema guessing, no encoding issues.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="approach-item">
				<h3>Compliance First</h3>
				<p>NO-PII declarations, data lineage tracking, and institutional-grade documentation. Built for teams that need to pass compliance reviews.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h2>Our Products</h2>

		<div class="product-list">
			<div class="product-item">
				<div class="product-item-header">
					<h3><a href="/products/zephyr-forge">Zephyr Forge</a></h3>
					<span class="product-tag available">Available</span>
				</div>
				<p>Curated crypto OHLCV dataset — 4 niche chains, 4 exchanges, 3 timeframes. Multi-exchange aligned with outlier detection. 414K+ rows in Parquet. <a href="/products/zephyr-forge">$29 on Gumroad →</a></p>
			</div>
			<div class="product-item">
				<div class="product-item-header">
					<h3><a href="/products/zephyr-data-factory">Zephyr Data Factory</a></h3>
					<span class="product-tag coming">Coming Soon</span>
				</div>
				<p>Dataset API subscription — programmatic access to curated data with incremental updates, usage-based billing, and multi-format output. <a href="/products/zephyr-data-factory">Learn more →</a></p>
			</div>
			<div class="product-item">
				<div class="product-item-header">
					<h3><a href="/products/zeph-trans">Zeph-Trans</a></h3>
					<span class="product-tag coming">Coming Soon</span>
				</div>
				<p>Crypto industry translation tool — domain-aware, context-preserving, powered by curated datasets. Supports multiple AI backends and custom glossaries. <a href="/products/zeph-trans">Learn more →</a></p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h2>Not Templates. Not Hype. Data.</h2>

		<p>The internet is full of digital nomad templates, AI prompt packs, and "build in public" content. We're not that.</p>

		<p>We build the kind of data products that quants, researchers, and AI engineers actually need — real datasets, with real provenance, at reasonable prices. No fluff. No "10x your life" promises. Just clean, reliable data you can build on.</p>

		<h2>Contact</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>X: <a href="https://twitter.com/zephyr_8379" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@zephyr_8379</a></li>
			<li>Email: Yakovxia@gmail.com</li>
		</ul>
	</main>
	<Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.about-page {
		max-width: 720px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		line-height: 1.7;
	}
	.about-lead {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		color: var(--color-white);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}
	.about-page h1,
	.about-page h2 {
		color: var(--color-white);
		margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem;
	}
	.about-page h1 {
		margin-top: 0;
	}
	.about-page a {
		color: var(--color-blue);
	}
	.about-page ul {
		padding-left: 1.25rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}
	.approach-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		gap: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}
	.approach-item {
		padding: 1.25rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border-soft);
		border-radius: var(--radius-md);
		background: var(--color-card);
	}
	.approach-item h3 {
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: var(--color-white);
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
	}
	.approach-item p {
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
		margin: 0;
	}
	.product-list {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1.25rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}
	.product-item {
		padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border-soft);
		border-radius: var(--radius-md);
		background: var(--color-card);
	}
	.product-item-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}
	.product-item-header h3 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}
	.product-item-header h3 a {
		color: var(--color-white);
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	.product-item-header h3 a:hover {
		color: var(--color-blue);
	}
	.product-tag {
		display: inline-block;
		padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}
	.product-tag.available {
		background: #22c55e;
		color: #fff;
	}
	.product-tag.coming {
		background: #f59e0b;
		color: #fff;
	}
	.product-item p {
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		font-size: 0.92rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		margin: 0;
	}
	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.approach-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
